===Etymology===
Via other European languages, ultimately a {{borrowing|ms|Jepang|Japan|lang=lv|nocap=1}}, itself a [[borrowing]] from {{etyl|nan|lv}} {{m|nan|日本|tr=Ji̍t-pún}}, literally “sunrise” (the same meaning of {{etyl|ja|-}} {{m|ja|日本|tr=Nip-pon}}), made, like most other country names, into a feminine 4th-declension noun.

===Pronunciation===
{{audio|lv-riga-Japāna.ogg|lang=lv}}

===Proper noun===
{{lv-proper noun|f|4th}}

# [[Japan]] {{gloss|an [[island]] [[country]] in the [[Far East]] [[region]] of [[Asia]], with [[Tokyo]] as its [[capital]]}}
#: '''''Japānas''' karogs'' — the flag of '''Japan'''
#: '''''Japānas''' vēsture'' — the history of '''Japan'''
#: '''''Japāna''' ir unitāra konstitucionāla monarhija'' — '''Japan''' is a unitary constitutional monarchy

